# Live-fleet capture used by the local cutover check. Contains real machine
# names, mesh addresses and public keys, so it must never reach the public repo
# (see tests/freeze/README.md). The committed golden files are synthetic.
tests/freeze/live-capture.json

# The native tray's build output -- cargo's target/ and Tauri's codegen gen/ -- is
# ignored by clients/tray/.gitignore, which git reads relative to that directory.
